<title>UK: BNG sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 500 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    01.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.87    PAY DATE    01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.62     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST/FFT  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 119</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p> NOTES	BANQUE PARIBAS IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
